WEBVTT

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:08.170
By joining our revolt, Princess,
you will strengthen our solidarity.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:13.750
There will be a victory prayer service today
at the new Royal Cathedral.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:19.130
Key members of the royal family and
various lords and ladies will be in attendance.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.790
Of course that includes Her Majesty the Queen.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.380
We will wait for the ceremony to begin,

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.670
and then drop the cathedral's ceiling.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:27.960
The ceiling?

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.420
It's exactly what it sounds like.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:35.250
Many of the laborers who built the cathedral
are fellow believers in our cause.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:40.290
The colonies are ruled by the Kingdom,
and their people make up most of the workforce,

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.330
but they are only granted
the bare minimum of human rights.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.920
Their outrage was inevitable.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:50.420
Princess Charlotte,
I swear this revolution will succeed.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.630
Immigration, poverty, classism.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.540
Those are the reasons you fight.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.500
But I can't let you do it.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.000
Not a revolution.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.960
Zelda has set out for the new royal cathedral.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.210
In eight hours, the government
will have changed hands.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.670
Just as we planned.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:19.630
I knew the old-fashioned intelligence
committees' methods were outdated.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.170
What happened to Seven?

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.000
What?

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.250
Oh, she's out skiving off.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:35.380
I have good news.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.210
With Zelda's assistance,

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:38.460
we've gained a powerful ally.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.040
The more people are around,
the harder it will be to make any moves.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:56.130
I have to do something
while they still think I'm on their side.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:01.710
I'm betting the odds of this revolution's
success are less than one in ten.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:04.710
But that will be good enough.

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:07.420
It will cause enough strife within the Kingdom

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:09.710
to give the Commonwealth's forces
the perfect chance to invade.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:14.710
Control is backing this revolution,
knowing it will fail?

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.750
Does it hurt to think of your people?

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.460
I'd expect nothing less of the REAL princess.

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:25.080
You were brilliant. At first, you even had me fooled.

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.420
How did you dupe Ange?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.710
I don't understand what you're saying.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.130
If you're thinking about stopping the revolution,

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.960
you're wasting your energy.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:39.630
If it comes down to it, I'll kill you myself.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.790
We're going to turn this revolution
into a revenge war.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:56.130
If you were going to run away anyway,
I wish you'd left me out of this from the start!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:59.210
My life is not yours to play with!

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.710
Princess?!

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:05.540
Wait!

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.920
If Operation: Changeling means that
one of us has to disappear,

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.000
then you can disappear without me.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.040
From the day we met,
I've always hated that about you.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.210
Goodbye, Ange.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.830
Never let me see you again.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:37.880
No!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.210
This is...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:11.040
But it's the old you that I love so much.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.880
Princess?

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:22.330
Mobilize the firefighters!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.630
Prepare to land, just in case!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:28.920
In here!

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.170
What's going on?

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.580
Unbolt this door!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.540
Who are you?

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.460
Hey, wait!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.540
I have to be sure!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.000
That idiot!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.080
An ox?

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.830
Chancellor of the Realm

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.130
and Ambassador Extraordinary and
Plenipotentiary of the Eastern Land of Japan,

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:34.630
Lord Horikawa Masayasu desires to attend
your nation's victory prayer service.

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:50.080
First I have to figure out where Princess is.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:06.500
Yes.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:10.500
Once the people find out that Princess
was involved with the assassination of the Queen,

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.880
the whole Kingdom will fall into chaos.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.290
And we'll be finished with her
as soon as the operation is over?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.580
What a pity.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.330
What's wrong? What was that sound?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.330
What happened?

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.420
Where is Princess?

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.920
Answer my question if you don't want to die.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.170
The new... royal cathedral.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.540
What are your plans?

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.830
T-to assassinate the Queen!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.170
To what end?

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:45.420
To put Princess at the center of the assassination...

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.460
And provoke the rebel army to action.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.500
And that's where Zelda is?

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.710
Yes.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.460
Do you really think you can get away with this?

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:56.540
I'll be fine.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:58.880
As long as you don't talk.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:06:59.750
Wait!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.460
Goodbye.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.210
You idiot!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.460
I was trying so hard to be discreet here!

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:11.710
Dorothy? How...?

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:16.000
The government ordered me here
to figure out Zelda's plot.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:20.080
They're playing musical chairs with the military
and we got stuck in the middle.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:23.460
Things are pretty tense
in the Commonwealth right now.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.540
Beatrice. Get over here.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:32.040
It was Ange. She ruined our whole operation.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.290
Dorothy.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.170
We have to go help Princess.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:41.420
Rescuing Princess was not part of
my mission directive.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:43.920
Oh.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.540
We are spies.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.250
I can't assist with anything outside of my mission.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.040
But...

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.130
If you ask me for a favor, as a friend...

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.920
I'll do everything in my power to help you.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.460
Thank you.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.580
Miss Ange is back?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.880
Yup. She just got here.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.580
Where have you been?!

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.380
We've been ready and waiting for ages!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:14.960
Waiting?

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:22.330
Yes! We know exactly where Her Highness is,
but Dorothy said we had to wait until-

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.580
Liar!

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.880
You can forgive a little white lie.

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:30.380
Besides, if you had been open with me from the start,

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.420
this would've gone a little more smoothly.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.080
I'm sorry.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.250
Come on, you two!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.000
Never mind that!

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.250
If we don't hurry, Her Highness will...!

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:40.580
Stop!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.830
The service starts at 1900 hours.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.960
If we take normal roads, we'll be late.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.710
Can we make it?

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.170
Leave it to me!

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:08.630
Princess!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:10.330
It's true! She's here!

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.000
Please wait here.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.170
For you, Princess.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.420
Thank you.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.170
I-it's nothing.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.000
We have scones, too, if you like.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.670
P-please excuse me!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:39.170
Don't worry about it.

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.630
I know. Why don't you join me?

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:43.790
Why don't you ALL join me?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.790
Your concern is unnecessary, Princess.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:51.330
Satisfying the hunger of four or five men will hardly-

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.330
No.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.290
I'm doing it for myself.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.920
I mean, eating is so much nicer
with good company, don't you think?

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.670
What's this...?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.170
Oi! Stop! Stop the car!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.920
This road is closed today!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.170
I'm sorry.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:13.380
We're just in such a hurry.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.750
We're running late for the service.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:18.750
Won't you please let us use the Wall Road?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.630
Oh, is that the problem?

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:22.750
Let us open the-

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:23.880
Wait a moment.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:27.830
I heard that the princess was already
inside the Royal Cathedral.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.710
We're going to have to see some identification.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:31.920
Floor it.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.130
Hey!

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.210
Stop!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.460
Intruders?

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.040
Yes.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.750
One disguised as Princess Charlotte.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.460
Find them and dispose of them.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:57.580
Yes, Sir.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.500
Her Majesty has arrived!

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:03.920
Major.

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:05.540
The Queen is here.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.960
So it's time then.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.540
Don't worry, Your Highness.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:11.920
Our plan is foolproof.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:13.920
But Major Yngwie...

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.750
How exactly are you going to drop the ceiling?

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.880
I'll use a key to activate the-

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:20.880
Major.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.250
Show some consideration.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.170
The Queen is a member of Princess' family.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.130
She's right.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.790
That was thoughtless of me.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.710
Not at all.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.790
I agreed to this plan for my own ambition.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.670
But I don't think it's right
to be the only one whose hands stay clean.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.750
Major.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:44.460
I don't suppose you would let me hold on to that key?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.500
No, that would...

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:49.710
Princess.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.420
I'll have a private room prepared.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.420
You should get some rest.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.960
I'm not tired.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.960
Please get some rest.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.380
Alright. I'll accept your offer.

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.380
Thank you. It was delicious.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.000
It is an honor.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:10.080
Major.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.250
I'll take care of that key.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.250
Certainly.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.130
It's gone!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.630
But that's impossible!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:19.750
Princess!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.000
Wait!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:26.420
Before you retire to your room,
I'd like to search your effects.

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:36.710
Oh?

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.000
Does this mean you suspect me?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.960
We never were going to get along, were we?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.040
You sneaky little brat.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.000
You were careless, Major.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.500
Zelda, what just...?

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.170
Don't worry about it.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:06.130
I hadn't told her about the assassination.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:09.880
Yngwie, you're still in charge of the ceiling.

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:13.000
Do what you have to do.

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:16.380
The trumpets of Jericho have already sounded.

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.250
They're coming after us!

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.380
Fire!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.130
On the right! Fire!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.460
I have a request.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:47.710
I ask permission to leave your side
to attend to urgent business.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:50.580
You would abandon your duty?

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.080
I beg of you.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.500
Miss Dorothy, can't you go any faster?!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.210
If I could, I would!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.210
How's that?

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.210
Dammit!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.000
Fire!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.920
Are we out of options?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.670
Should we capture them?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:39.580
No. Corpses are easier to deal with.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.000
What the-?

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.580
Something's not right.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.250
I wonder what's wrong.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:58.880
Chise!
Miss Chise!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.080
To repay your hospitality.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:05.540
All of you, forward!

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:11.830
What?

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:17.210
Assassinate the Queen?

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.420
How unsettling.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:22.040
We think Princess is in
the Royal Cathedral with Zelda.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.040
I saw Zelda in a room above the stairwell.

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:27.290
Really?

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.330
I would not lie about this.

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.790
I saw it from the chapel.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.750
Ange, you go help Princess!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.290
Take me with you!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.830
You can't drop the ceiling!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.670
If you start a revolution through bloodshed,

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:51.080
someone else will start a new revolution
to right all your wrongs!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.290
Princess, this nation is corrupt.

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:58.040
We are going to take action,
and eliminate the social hierarchy!

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.500
I know how you feel!

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:04.580
And so I promise you that I will become Queen,
and I will change this country.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.330
Major.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.630
Don't listen to her. You've already-

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.710
Princess.

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:19.080
The promise you just made would mean
renouncing your own position.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.290
Do you really think you can change the country?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.500
Yes.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.630
And I will likely be its last queen.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.080
I suspect my reign will end on the guillotine.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.380
How could you...

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.750
Zelda! What are you...!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.250
Don't listen to her lies.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:46.790
This revolution isn't just for you anymore.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:50.830
I... made a promise...

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:56.250
When the Revolution tore my friend from me...
I promised I would make her dream come true!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:03.380
I may be an imposter, but seeing this country
for the past ten years, I realized.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.290
It wasn't only us.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:10.040
So many people in this nation have been
torn from each other by invisible walls.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:15.540
When she said she wanted to get rid of the Wall,
I didn't know what she meant.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:21.040
If it meant getting rid of all the pain and sadness,
I sincerely wanted it to happen.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:25.330
But I took away her chance!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:30.420
So I swore I would
change the country in her place!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.040
Princess.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.460
If you don't stop spouting that nonsense,
I'll kill you right now.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:38.920
You can't!

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:41.580
Our country needs her!

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:46.380
Please, Zelda. Give us a little time.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.580
We can still try to figure out
if this is really the best solution.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:51.960
Can we, now?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.670
He was weak.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.750
You're a formidable woman.

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.330
But I think you will serve me better dead.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.830
You're too much for me to handle.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.040
Princess?

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:18.500
Princess!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.040
Ange!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.130
How is she?

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.750
She has lost much blood.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.540
We must tend to her quickly.

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:42.250
It's started.

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:43.790
What do we do?

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:47.580
If we bust up the service, then their
assassination plot will be ruined, too, right?

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:48.750
Huh? Wait a-

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.040
Ange!

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:58.380
I will handle things here! Go!

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.710
I'm sorry, Chise!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:01.420
Princess.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:06.250
You... are our true Queen.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:10.420
So please... you mustn't die.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.880
I won't.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:16.920
Let's go.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.460
Zelda!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:24.420
What the-

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.330
Is that a...?

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.880
I guess it's time to retreat.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.540
Wait!

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:53.330
Charlotte. You couldn't stay away, could you?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.790
Princess!

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:55.960
I'm sorry!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.500
I was so stupid!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:19:59.380
It's my fault you...

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:01.460
Don't cry.

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:04.540
I'm the one who's sorry.

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:08.250
I lied to you.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.290
I knew.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:12.250
Dorothy told me...

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:16.290
I should have asked all of you for help
from the beginning.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:18.790
She's right.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:22.250
You're always running off into danger alone,
never listening to anyone else.

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:26.710
There's always been an invisible wall
around your heart.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.790
Princess!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.000
I promise you again.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.500
I'll break the wall around your heart, too.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:41.540
And I'll never leave your side until the day comes
that you can smile for all of us.

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:46.710
Yeah.

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:24.250
You let them escape?

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:25.960
Mistakes were made.

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.630
I am terribly sorry.

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:29.710
No matter.

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:33.250
Your efforts weren't entirely fruitless.

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:38.790
The idiots! What the hell were they doing?!

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:40.670
They defied my orders!

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:42.500
Where did the Principal Team head off-

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:56.710
Where is our Principal Team?

00:22:56.920 --> 00:22:58.790
They are currently recuperating.

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:00.170
Where?

00:23:00.290 --> 00:23:01.710
Casablanca.

00:23:02.960 --> 00:23:05.500
Contact them straightaway.

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:11.000
A man with a white flower made advances at me.

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:11.710
What?

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:13.330
R-really?

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.960
He gave me new orders.

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:19.920
General Al-Kadil is in hiding.
We need to find out what he's up to.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:22.290
Oh, is that all?

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:25.880
Well, that's pretty much how our luck with men goes.

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:29.750
I cannot imagine Ange
in a romantic affair in any case.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:32.040
Watch your tongue. Believe it or not, I-

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.330
I'm spotting movement.

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:36.880
Just one, eh?

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:39.500
That woman appears to be in the military.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.080
Alright, ladies. Just as we discussed.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:42.960
Right.

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:46.790
Well, that's the end of our holiday.

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:50.000
No, we'll finish this up and get right back to it.

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:54.170
Then when you get back,
we'll really let our hair down.

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:58.250
Like old times?

00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:00.210
Just like old times.

00:24:01.670 --> 00:24:04.130
But this time, we'll have all our friends.

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:06.040
I don't know...
